pageType: chapter
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: left-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 120, 4, 80]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: ch-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 110, 1100, 50]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      fontSize: 36
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Direction 15: SmartNIC / Trusted NIC / Secure Storage</p>
  - elementId: ch-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 160, 1100, 40]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$secondary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>S-NIC, TNIC, and Hazel for NIC Isolation & Storage</p>
  - elementId: intro-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 220, 1120, 70]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      wrap: true
      text: |
        <p>SmartNIC / trusted NIC / secure storage data path 的核心是先界定保护对象、管理边界和证据强度，再用三篇主讲材料串起技术演进。</p>
  - elementId: paper-list
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 300, 1120, 380]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      wrap: true
      text: |
        <p>• - 'S-NIC: SmartNIC function isolation — 开创/基础入口 (E1 / 同行评审改进证据)</p>
        <p>• - 'TNIC: trusted NIC architecture — 代表性改进 (E1 / 同行评审改进证据)</p>
        <p>• - 'Hazel: secure disaggregated storage data path — 当前 SOTA/补充边界 (E3 / 草案/未批准规范)</p>
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
